                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.51 Public Works Debt/134: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Beaulac</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-10-12T14:00:00-05:00">October 12, 1938—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 2:35 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>114. My 113, of October 11, 1 p.m. With reference to our recent telephone
                    conversation it would be helpful to me if I could be informed regarding your
                    conversations with the Cuban Ambassador.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaulac</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
